{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788285415473,"sessionID":"ses_fa1e38ef0ffeIEpkD87gUaZnL0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9c5027b409a6dd29","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"Brazilian Soccer MCP Server package.\"\"\"\n\nfrom .loader import SoccerData\nfrom .queries import SoccerQueries\n\n__all__ = [\"SoccerData\", \"SoccerQueries\"]\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-tfe1ts5p/retort-af9123f1c3a8/brazilian_soccer/__init__.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-tfe1ts5p/retort-af9123f1c3a8/brazilian_soccer/__init__.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"brazilian_soccer/__init__.py","time":{"start":1788285415463,"end":1788285415472}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now implement. Plan files:\n\n- `brazilian_soccer/` package:\n  - `__init__.py`\n  - `loader.py` — loads all 6 CSVs, normalizes team names/dates\n  - `queries.py` — match search, team stats, h2h, standings, player search, competition stats, biggest wins, avg goals\n- `server.py` — FastMCP server exposing tools\n- `requirements.txt`\n- `tests/test_bdd.py` — pytest BDD-style scenarios\n- `pytest.ini` maybe\n\nTeam name normalization: strip state suffix after \"-\", handle accents (keep them but use unicodedata for fuzzy match — normalize by stripping accents and lowercasing for comparisons).\n\nStandings: compute from Brasileirao_Matches + novo (2003-2019) per season, 3 pts win.\n\nLet me write the package.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05e1dedc9001RtSIUodzc3macu","sessionID":"ses_fa1e38ef0ffeIEpkD87gUaZnL0","messageID":"msg_05e1ddbb3001r82Cwg84Cvsmon"}}
